    "The concentration is recorded as one 18-semester-hour block because the student's choice is unknown. The Digital Communication and Media Design option is COMM356, COMM365, COMM375, COMM385, COMM415 and COMM456, at 3 each. The Strategic Communication option is COMM351, COMM361, COMM370, COMM380, COMM410 and COMM450, at 3 each.",
